struct Kernel{int index;f64 gain;}struct Other{int index;f64 gain;}struct Box<T>{T value;}struct Phantom<T>{int tag;}T id<T>(T value){return value;}T same<T>(T a,T b){return a;}
T bad<T>(Box<T> x){return x.value;}
int main(){Box<int> scalar={value=42};Kernel item={index=47,gain=3.5d};Box<Kernel> record={value=item};var copied=bad(record);if(bad<int>(scalar)!=42||copied.index!=47||copied.gain!=3.5d){return 1;}return 0;}
